-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Reprobe can import attack seeds from external corpora. Imported seeds retain
their origin in the `source` field of each seed record, and findings derived
from them carry that attribution through to the exported report. Where this
repository vendors or redistributes such material, it is listed here together
with its upstream licence.

At present no third-party attack corpus is vendored in this repository.
